#: lib/bridge_for_teams_web/dashboard/live/triage_live/index.ex:846
msgid ""
"Salix could not be reached, so the switch was not changed. This is a "
"transient fault, not a missing connect — the state below was re-read; try "
"again."
msgstr ""
"无法连接 Salix，开关未被改动。这是一次瞬时故障，不是连接丢失——下方状态已重新"
"读取，请重试。"

#: lib/bridge_for_teams_web/dashboard/live/triage_live/index.ex:836
msgid ""
"Salix did not answer in time, so the result is unconfirmed: the change may "
"or may not have landed. The state below was re-read after the attempt — "
"check it before retrying."
msgstr ""
"Salix 未在时限内响应，结果无法确认：改动可能已生效，也可能没有。下方状态已在"
"本次尝试后重新读取，请先核对再重试。"

#: lib/bridge_for_teams_web/dashboard/live/triage_live/index.ex:3883
msgid "Start from the first page"
msgstr "从第一页开始"

#: lib/bridge_for_teams_web/dashboard/live/triage_live/index.ex:822
msgid "That connect is no longer part of this organization."
msgstr "该连接已不属于本组织。"

#: lib/bridge_for_teams_web/dashboard/live/triage_live/index.ex:852
msgid "The Triage switch could not be changed (%{reason})."
msgstr "Triage 开关改动失败（%{reason}）。"

#: lib/bridge_for_teams_web/dashboard/live/triage_live/index.ex:3895
msgid ""
"The access record failed to write, so the body was never fetched — nothing "
"was read and nothing is shown. This does not establish whether the file "
"exists or is empty: its content was never looked at, because an unaudited "
"read of user data would be worse than no read."
msgstr ""
"访问记录写入失败，因此从未去取文件正文——没有读取任何内容，也没有渲染任何内"
"容。这并不说明该文件是否存在或是否为空：它的内容根本没有被查看过，因为对用户"
"数据进行未经审计的读取，比不读取更糟。"

#: lib/bridge_for_teams_web/dashboard/live/triage_live/index.ex:3873
msgid ""
"The cursor in the address bar does not address a position in this scan (%"
"{reason}). Nothing is wrong with the data — the link was truncated, hand-"
"edited, or left over from an older page shape."
msgstr ""
"地址栏中的游标没有指向本次扫描中的任何位置（%{reason}）。数据本身没有问题——这"
"个链接被截断、被手工改过，或者来自旧版页面。"

#: lib/bridge_for_teams_web/dashboard/live/triage_live/index.ex:586
msgid ""
"The message text could not be revealed: the access record failed to write."
msgstr "消息正文无法显示：访问记录写入失败。"

#: lib/bridge_for_teams_web/dashboard/live/triage_live/index.ex:3909
msgid ""
"The read failed (%{reason}). This is not an empty result: rows may exist and "
"could not be fetched. The rest of the page is unaffected."
msgstr ""
"读取失败（%{reason}）。这不是空结果：数据可能存在，只是取不到。本页其余部分不"
"受影响。"

#: lib/bridge_for_teams_web/dashboard/live/triage_live/index.ex:2258
msgid "The receipt keyspace is key-ordered, so this is a scan, not a query"
msgstr "回执键空间按键排序，所以这是一次扫描，不是一次查询"

#: lib/bridge_for_teams_web/dashboard/live/triage_live/index.ex:3355
msgid ""
"The requested agent is not one of this organization's router agents. Showing "
"%{name} instead — this is not that agent's memory."
msgstr ""
"请求的 Agent 不属于本组织的 router agent。现在展示的是 %{name}——这不是那个 "
"Agent 的记忆。"

#: lib/bridge_for_teams_web/dashboard/live/triage_live/index.ex:2273
msgid ""
"The scan budget ran out before the window completed: rows may be missing. "
"These counts are a floor, not a total."
msgstr ""
"扫描预算在窗口走完前就用尽了：可能有数据缺失。这些数字是下限，不是总数。"

#: lib/bridge_for_teams_web/dashboard/live/triage_live/index.ex:4826
msgid ""
"The scan completed and found no typed receipts for this organization in the "
"last %{count} days."
msgstr "扫描已完成，最近 %{count} 天内没有找到属于本组织的类型化回执。"

#: lib/bridge_for_teams_web/dashboard/live/triage_live/index.ex:3590
msgid ""
"The scan returned no typed receipts belonging to this organization here."
msgstr "扫描在这里没有返回任何属于本组织的类型化回执。"

#: lib/bridge_for_teams_web/dashboard/live/triage_live/index.ex:3574
msgid ""
"These counts describe the unfiltered page: they are scan health, not this "
"organization's content. The keyspace is key-ordered, so a page is a position "
"in a scan and not a moment in time."
msgstr ""
"这些数字描述的是未经过滤的整页：它们反映扫描健康度，而不是本组织的内容。键空"
"间按键排序，所以一页是扫描中的一个位置，而不是某个时刻。"

#: lib/bridge_for_teams_web/dashboard/live/triage_live/index.ex:3493
msgid "This file is longer than the render limit and has been cut short."
msgstr "该文件超出渲染上限，已被截断。"

